## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)
zh-hans-b #27, the form "157万9589元" for 新台币1,579,589元. That is not one amount. 157万 is 1,570,000, and 9589 is a second number. The comma form is the judgment figure. Round amounts in 万/亿 would be natural mainland grouping, but this checker's magnitude step only multiplies 萬/億 (not 万/亿), so "2500万元" is read as 2500 and "1亿元" drops 100,000,000. Those strings were not introduced.

Nothing else in the two reviews was rejected as wrong. The U+200B rows were skipped because the checker pins the count. The 015 suggestion that pastes the next paragraph (including 2023年1月1日) into this one was rephrased inside the existing block instead, so the date is not counted twice.
